OL,3,GNEWSAPolice car set alight in Glasgow
OL,4,Aamid Bonfire Night trouble
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice and members of the public were
OL,7,Falso targeted with fireworks in several
OL,8,Fareas of Edinburgh. Fire service
OL,9,Fpersonnel also came under attack in a
OL,10,Fnumber of towns while responding to
OL,11,Fcalls.
